    ],
    "text": "Reference No.: 3/7/14/2. Land Ministry Reference No.: 04-3/8/2012/PC/236.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      423.21,
      286.42,
      488.2
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to the following land which is required for a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      5.039495944976807,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      489.67,
      221.4,
      499.75
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      500.93,
      288.84,
      576.8
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land called Mulhalkele Estate plain total extent about 0.0169 shown as Lots Number 01 of P.P.N. 3134 situated in the village of Wathumulla in 515 B, Walapane Division in Divisional Secretary Division of Walapane in Nuwara Eliya District in Central Province and described as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      586.68,
      286.38,
      642.32
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01 Name of Land: Mulhalkele Estate; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Land Reform Commission; Land Use: Garden, Part of Permanent Building; Extent: 0.0169 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      360.32,
      539.37,
      485.36
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear, personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office Walapane on the 20th day of December, 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 06th day of December, 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      497.62,
      506.04,
      556.4
    ],
    "text": "I. M. SENANAYAKA, Divisional Secretary, Walapane.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
